  "candidateDecisions": {
    "Philosophy": "Mind and self modules strengthen the broad response. The active courses do not establish a separate, comparably deep philosophy-of-language route.",
    "Musicology": "Creative performance and screen sound provide supporting context. They do not form a sustained musicology or music cognition curriculum.",
    "Language and Communication Studies": "Use the stable communication and language interests in the broad response. Psycholinguistics, stylistics and persuasion provide real depth. UCR lacks a sequence in core linguistics or Dutch language and literature sufficient for another distinct option."
  }
